me":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","review_id":"HISNUyX1exrAygazzd8NhA","date":"2021-02-06T21:31:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372551441192627,"text_excerpt":"I really enjoyed this place. The food was good, but the drinks and service were better. Great ambiance, I definitely recommend getting an outside table, they have outdoor heaters so you should be fine as long as it isn't too cold outside. Our waiter Tatiana was so nice and very knowledgeable of the menu. We didn't know what to get for our drink and she recommend the Starry Eyes, let's just say it gave me starry eyes lol. For appetizers we got the Mac and cheese and gem salad. Both were good but their Mac and cheese is a must try, very flavorful and cheesy. I got the burger and fries for my meal, it was good. My friend got the chicken sandwich and really enjoyed it. I will be back, great l..."},{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","review_id":"ST3CgNxunlMFqivJ5Un5Bw","date":"2020-10-04T20:04:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9307089447975159,"text_excerpt":"i've been wanting to check this place out and it did not disappoint! they took covid precautions very seriously and had certain tables closed off. they take reservations to ensure your spot and you can call or go on open table. the staff wore masks the whole time. i checked out the upstairs because they have a cute new private patio area and it would be perfect to have a small dinner up there. beautiful plants and atmosphere on the rooftop patio. we had lunch below. the service was great and staff was accommodating. we tried the broccoli and cheese curds as a started and they were both incredible. the broccoli had the most incredible flavor. it had a great sauce. the cheese curds were yum..."},{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","review_id":"VEmnp4gnZSo0IucSsO257w","date":"2020-01-18T16:49:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9291494488716125,"text_excerpt":"Came to check out this new place Friday evening about 630. We had a 5-10 minuet wait. We were seeates on time. We ordered the cheese curds and Brussels Spouts. Each were delicious I was super impressed with the Brussels Spouts delicious with an Asian Flair. Each of us ordered the Junior Burger cooked prefect, French fries fries were fresh and crispy. I love the concept of this place simple food done right. A place whEre you can brings the kids for burgers and ice cream or head up stairs for drinks on date night"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","photo_id":"r2UNNl445YKBm86Df_Bj0g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/r2UNNl445YKBm86Df_Bj0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9031471610069275},{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","photo_id":"ijDiTZ64ujHwwejf0iKYpw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ijDiTZ64ujHwwejf0iKYpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8893790245056152},{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","photo_id":"o3AVJ78DeIpBq0g7L7C3_A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/o3AVJ78DeIpBq0g7L7C3_A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.874396800994873},{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","photo_id":"NV4Qs76vizXNRfVNscjnpw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NV4Qs76vizXNRfVNscjnpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8043522834777832},{"business_id":"3rRESenaBw-AyT0Jt7eJNg","photo_id":"LZtvziROpwebqO2DVQVkTw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LZtvziROpwebqO2DVQVkTw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7277759313583374}]},"notebook_case":null}
